  "description": "Activities become a request and a wait for completion, conditions a switch in jq, retries a try, timers waits, publishing an emit, waits a listen with correlation and timeout; what does not map is listed.",
  "workflow": {
    "id": "a9d1ff95-b9ff-5eaf-99a3-7acd08f183d0",
